items.stickyText:
Update the fonts and colors used on the prototype to these:
:root {
  --cg-100: #282C33;
  --cg-80:  #4C535D;
  --cg-30:  #A9AFB8;
  --cg-10:  #DFE3E8;
  --cg-5:   #F2F3F5;
  --white:  #FFFFFF;

  --blue-60:   #1071E5; /* primary accent */
  --indigo-60: #635DFF;
  --pink-60:   #D916A8;

  --font-primary:   "Graphik", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-secondary: "Graphik Wide", "Graphik", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-tertiary:  "Self Modern", Georgia, serif; /* italic, never all caps */
}
